OL,3,AGoogle outage hits websites and apps as
OL,4,Asome bank customers report issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle says "multiple" Cloud services
OL,7,Fare suffering network failures
OL,9,F"We are experiencing an issue with
OL,10,Fmultiple services in europe-west2", the
OL,11,Fcompany says, adding that issues began
OL,12,Faround 07:00 BST
OL,14,FThe company adds its "engineering team
OL,15,Fcontinues to investigate the issue"
OL,17,FOnline bank Revolut, delivery service
OL,18,FDPD and Royal Mail are among the
OL,19,Fbusinesses reporting issues, according
OL,20,Fto Downdetector - here are some others
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
